Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.01,0:01:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿你坠入地狱 炼狱之火燃烧不歇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jezerael burn forever and a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.20,0:01:33.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿你邪恶的身躯为豺狼所吞噬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May thy foul prophecy food for the jackals{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.96,0:01:37.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的血因此而变得纯洁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and thy blood crave for purity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.00,0:02:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《最后的吸血鬼》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.02,0:03:24.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得我说服了她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought I persuaded her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.83,0:03:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们将请您在这个教堂里为孩子洗礼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We'd have the baby baptized here in this church by you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.44,0:03:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你明白女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well you know women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.80,0:03:32.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}邻村有一个天主教堂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh there's a Catholic church in the next village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.75,0:03:34.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卡洛塔发现了它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Carlotta has found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.25,0:03:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}星期天我们将分头行事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On Sunday's we go our separate ways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.81,0:03:36.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那小孩呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the child?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.72,0:03:37.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No,No,No,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.66,0:03:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他跟我在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He stays with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.05,0:03:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这点我很坚持{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm resolved on that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.65,0:03:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其他事情你太太都适应了吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Most other things your wife has adapted well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.37,0:03:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.80,0:03:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的气候呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our climate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.36,0:03:51.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 气候不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No not the climate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.88,0:03:54.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的孩子 杰克 他的反应如何？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your boy,Jack,how is he responding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.04,0:03:58.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 这个我们也会很快解决的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well we'll resolve that too in good time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.52,0:04:00.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对你来说可不容易{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not easy for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.08,0:04:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 不过我爱我的妻子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No but I love my wife about this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.62,0:04:03.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而爱能征服一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and love conquers all{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.04,0:04:05.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这可是您布道的时候常说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as you've always preached from your pulpit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.85,0:04:10.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 斯托克顿 今晚晚餐在八点钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh Stockton? Dinner tonight eight o'clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.27,0:04:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}八点钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eight o'clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.15,0:04:14.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有意思的一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Interesting man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.65,0:04:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说对了 他是在秘鲁呆过一段时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you were right he has spent some time in Peru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.53,0:04:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经邀请他过来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've invited him over{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.82,0:04:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样可以让卡洛塔有回家的感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to make Carlotta feel at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.49,0:04:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从这儿滚开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go away from here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.61,0:04:37.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杀人犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Murderer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.30,0:05:17.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不要再吵了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You stop this noise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.36,0:05:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在 求你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.82,0:05:28.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你惊扰到小孩了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You upset baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.14,0:05:31.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你没听到吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't you hear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.96,0:05:34.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要是让我吻你的话 我会停下来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll stop if you let me kiss you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.99,0:05:37.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吻吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kiss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.29,0:05:41.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要吻我吗 杰克？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You kiss me Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.94,0:05:44.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吻哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.69,0:05:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你想吻哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where you wish?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.81,0:05:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}双唇吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On the lips?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.93,0:05:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是脖子？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On the neck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.70,0:05:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}靴子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On the boot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.14,0:05:58.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你吻我的靴子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You kiss my boot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.94,0:06:07.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来啊 如果你那么渴望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}come on if you want it so bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.37,0:06:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 迈克尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you Michael.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.54,0:06:48.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今晚我们请了一位客人来用晚餐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We've got a guest coming for dinner tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.14,0:06:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.28,0:06:51.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯托克顿先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Stockton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.04,0:07:26.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我让他别拉了 而他竟然侮辱我 太太{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I tell him to stop and he insult me senora.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.35,0:07:35.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克 立刻停下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack stop at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.63,0:07:37.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}停下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.09,0:07:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把它给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give it to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.97,0:07:59.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他吓到小孩了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He frightened the baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.44,0:08:01.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我什么也没干 父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did nothing Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.43,0:08:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在院子里就听见你拉琴了 孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I heard you from the yard boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.14,0:08:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你干嘛要这么做？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why are you doing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.45,0:08:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:12.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一直想要的就是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are all I've ever desired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.90,0:09:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会冻死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall die of cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.54,0:09:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No you won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.91,0:09:20.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个愉快的夜晚会让你很快暖和起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A convivial evening will soon warm your bones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.95,0:09:41.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}之前发生的事情我很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sorry what happened earlier{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:45.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是那孩子对德洛丽丝很粗鲁 非常粗鲁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but the boy was rude to the Delores,very rude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.37,0:09:46.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你应该让我来教育他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must leave him to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.01,0:09:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即使如此… 用这个给他买把新的提琴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even so this is for a new violin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.35,0:09:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没什么的 为什么不呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.31,0:10:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.68,0:10:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的孩子 你继母…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My boy your stepmother's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.48,0:10:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的客人已经到了 父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our guest has arrived father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.39,0:10:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯托克顿 亲爱的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stockton my dear fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的妻子 卡洛塔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My wife Carlotta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.71,0:11:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很高兴认识你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mucho gusto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.89,0:11:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我的孩子 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My boy Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.01,0:11:17.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是那位小提琴家？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The violinist?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.85,0:11:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们见过面？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You met each other?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.45,0:11:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在村子里见过 父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the village father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.67,0:11:23.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们谈到了远足{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We talked about hiking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.93,0:11:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚饭后为我们演奏吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'll play for us after dinner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.57,0:11:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我拉得还不够好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not good enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.11,0:11:36.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我们的骄傲和欢乐 我的儿子里卡多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And our pride and joy my son Ricardo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.09,0:12:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.45,0:12:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还好吧 老伙计？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You alright old man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.05,0:12:30.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抱歉吓到你了 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sorry to have alarmed you Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.51,0:12:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是你的反应是很有启发性的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but your reaction was instructive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.09,0:12:35.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么你相信它们是存在的了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So you believe in their existence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.93,0:12:37.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.39,0:12:38.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vampires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.82,0:12:40.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 我当然不信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No of course I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.73,0:12:42.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可你的反应正好相反{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're attitude suggests the contrary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.99,0:12:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个人被某种东西吓倒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No one has to believe in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.91,0:12:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并不意味着就相信它的存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}something to be frightened of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.14,0:12:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个分属于大脑的两个不同区域{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's two different parts of the brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.17,0:12:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.05,0:12:51.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么你就把它们排除了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So you rule them out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吸血鬼 哼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vampires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.38,0:12:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的理性让你坚持这种看法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The rational part of you insists upon it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.37,0:12:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你相信它们的存在喽？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well do you believe in them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.38,0:12:59.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看一眼这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cast your eyes over this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.66,0:13:04.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}老德鲁街46号   四月十二日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}46 Old Drury April 12th.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.00,0:13:06.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}回复: 吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Re: Vampires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.11,0:13:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}鄙公司委托人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our client,The Revered Locastos Merridew{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.33,0:13:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来自兰伯利教区 尊敬的卢卡斯托梅瑞德牧师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the Vicar's Lamberley{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.83,0:13:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在今天的事务中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}has made some inquiry from us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.39,0:13:13.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}向我们咨询{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in a communication of even date{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.13,0:13:16.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有关… 有关吸血鬼的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}concerning...concerning vampires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.99,0:13:19.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}由于鄙公司专营{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As our firm specializes entirely{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.87,0:13:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}机械估价业务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}upon the assessment of machinery,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.61,0:13:24.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此事完全 不在我们的业务范围之内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the matter hardly comes within our purview.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.15,0:13:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.50,0:13:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 亲爱的鲁多克小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh my dear Miss Ruddock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可怜啊 我是个可怜的女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wretched wretched woman I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.53,0:13:39.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么事让你心神不宁？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What disturbed you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.87,0:13:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们因此介绍梅瑞德牧师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We Have therefore recommended the Reverend Merridew{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.30,0:13:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来造访您并陈述详情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to call on you and lay the matter before you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.54,0:13:48.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阁下成功破解明德布里格斯一案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have not forgotten your successful action{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.87,0:13:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所予鄙公司之帮助永志难忘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the case of Matilda Briggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.47,0:13:51.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您忠诚的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are sirs,faithfully yours,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.96,0:13:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莫里森 莫里森&多德公司{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Morrison,Morrison and Dodd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.36,0:13:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这副杯碟在这儿 已有三天了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This cup and saucer has been here for the last 3 days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.24,0:14:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明德布里格斯是一艘船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Matilda Briggs' was a ship{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.84,0:14:04.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与苏门答腊岛的大老鼠有关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}associated with the giant rat of Sumatra{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.65,0:14:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个世人还没有做好心理准备的故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a story for which the world is not yet prepared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.02,0:14:08.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就算如此 你觉得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You consider though that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.13,0:14:11.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吸血鬼就是我们的业务范围？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}vampires should come within our purview?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.78,0:14:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.47,0:14:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么事都比目前这种没事干好啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anything is better than this stagnation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.22,0:14:17.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.10,0:14:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们似乎转向{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We seemed to have been switched on{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.56,0:14:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}某种格林童话之类的案子了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to some Grimm's fairytale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.72,0:14:24.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 这个梅瑞德可是个神职人员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well this Merridew is a man of the cloth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.75,0:14:26.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个信仰基督教的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man of Christian belief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.56,0:14:29.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那正是勉强算得上有趣的一点了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is of marginal interest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.30,0:14:30.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把手伸长了 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make a long arm,Watson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.66,0:14:32.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我们查查字母“V” 看有什么说法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Iet us see what the "V" has to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.32,0:14:54.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}格洛里亚斯科特航行记{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Voyage of the Gloria Scott{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.12,0:14:56.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是个很糟的案件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that was a bad business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.25,0:14:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还记得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have some recollection{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.57,0:14:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还做了些记录 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that you made a record of it Watson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.10,0:15:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然结果并不值得祝贺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}though I was unable to congratulate you upon the result.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.12,0:15:04.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}造伪钞者维克多林奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Victor Lynch and the forger,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.14,0:15:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有毒的蜥蜴或叫大毒蜥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Venomous Lizard or Gila,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.12,0:15:07.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是个很不寻常的案子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}remarkable case that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.89,0:15:09.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马戏团美女维多利亚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Victoria,the circus belle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.53,0:15:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}强盗范德比尔特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vanderbilt and the Yeggman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.13,0:15:12.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想喝点茶 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I should like some tea Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.31,0:15:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毒贩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vipers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.42,0:15:14.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}奇异锻工维戈尔…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vigor and the Hammersmith Wonder...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.95,0:15:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}did you say something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.17,0:15:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要不要我叫人送些茶上来？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shall I call down for some tea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.73,0:15:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好的旧索引{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good old index.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.19,0:15:20.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道你难不倒它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know you can't beat it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.55,0:15:22.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听听这个:匈牙利的吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Listen to this,vampirism in Hungary{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.46,0:15:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有特兰西瓦尼亚的吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and again vampires in Transylvania.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.09,0:15:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的朋友 发生什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My dear friend what has happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.07,0:15:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您能马上来一趟吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will you come at once?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.23,0:15:38.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 当然可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.24,0:15:41.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}垃圾 华生 都是些垃圾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rubbish Watson rubbish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.51,0:15:43.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些得在它们心脏里插上木棍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are we to do with walking corpses{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.56,0:15:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}才能让它们呆在坟墓里的行尸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that have to have stakes driven through their hearts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.44,0:15:47.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟我们有什么关系？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to keep them in their graves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.59,0:15:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样的东西真值得我们关注吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are we to give serious attention to such things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.35,0:15:53.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}完全是精神失常{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's pure lunacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.54,0:15:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 毫无疑问你是对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well no doubt your right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.22,0:15:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们这个事务所{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This agency{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.78,0:16:02.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}应该坚守它自己的立场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}must stand flat footed upon the ground of that it is to remain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.44,0:16:04.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}世界对我们来说够大了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The world is big enough for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.84,0:16:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没必要再去管什么鬼的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No ghost need apply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.82,0:16:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 对哦 鬼嘛…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Awe well now ghosts...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.52,0:16:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}却要我们去管{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Need apply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.82,0:16:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你打不打算告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you prepared to tell me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.35,0:16:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些是谁给你的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who supplied you with these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.93,0:16:22.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有给你干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And to what purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.60,0:16:24.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 我让帕秋姆的一个牙医{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well I had them made for me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.90,0:16:27.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给我做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by a dentist from Pachum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.54,0:16:32.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是我曾经一次需要的必要伪装{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was a necessary disguise I needed once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.44,0:16:33.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我忘了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.81,0:16:39.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你用过它们吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And did you put them to use?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.36,0:16:40.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}颇具打击性的幽默哦 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Balking humor again Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.93,0:16:43.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你真的要克制这种做法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You really must guard against it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.18,0:16:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阿尔伯特？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Albert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.02,0:16:45.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}街上有个人给了我这个 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man gave me this in the street sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.79,0:16:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一位上了年纪的先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Elderly gent,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.90,0:16:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他说他有急事要见您{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he says he's got to see you urgent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.54,0:16:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是你那位牧师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's your man of the cloth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.42,0:16:52.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让他进来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Show him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.12,0:16:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小心些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.51,0:16:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.34,0:16:55.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 阿尔伯特？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh Albert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.42,0:16:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.57,0:16:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你相信世上有吸血鬼吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you believe in the existence of vampires?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.11,0:17:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 是的 非常相信 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh yeah,most definitely sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.93,0:17:06.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是智慧的声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There speaks the voice of wisdom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.23,0:17:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信并无实在经历{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No experience I trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.24,0:17:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好啦 谢谢你 年轻人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes thank you young man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.22,0:17:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还不算老朽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not quite in my grave yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.07,0:17:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你好 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hello Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.71,0:17:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么急来找你 你能见我真好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}this is so good of you to see me on such notice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.59,0:17:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道你有多忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know how busy you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.61,0:17:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请坐下 牧师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sit down and settle yourself Reverend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.45,0:17:29.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.14,0:17:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}麻烦你叫威金斯送些茶进来好吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will you tell Wiggins to bring in the tea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.16,0:17:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 好的 先生 - 谢谢 阿尔伯特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yes sir. - Thank you Albert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.60,0:17:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这位是我的朋友和同事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is my friend and colleague.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.46,0:17:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生医生 是的… 是的 我认识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doctor Watson yes...yes I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.25,0:17:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的顾问{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now my solicitors,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.92,0:17:42.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莫里森 来自莫里森&…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Morrison,Morrison and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.43,0:17:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多德公司？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dodd?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.16,0:17:46.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实上他们并非真是我的顾问{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Point of fact there not really my solicitors{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.67,0:17:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是的 很久前我跟他们有些往来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}no I had some dealings with them long ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.91,0:17:54.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不太记得是关于什么事的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I forget quite what about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.56,0:17:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}机械{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Machinery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.02,0:17:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.55,0:17:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 不管怎么说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well anyway{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.84,0:18:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是代表我的朋友和我本人到这儿来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm here on behalf of a friend of mine and myself too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.03,0:18:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我非常希望你们不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I'm very anxious you shouldn't take me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.50,0:18:10.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把我当成一个老傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for a complete old fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.55,0:18:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.10,0:18:17.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你慢慢说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must take your time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.26,0:18:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从何说起呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where to start it all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.81,0:18:23.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是兰伯利教区的牧师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm Vicar of Lamberley;{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.90,0:18:26.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在那地方呆了很久了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've been there longer than I care to think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.33,0:18:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是该走人的时候了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only time to go but{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.70,0:18:30.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过让我跟你谈谈鲍勃弗格森{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Iet me tell you about Bob Ferguson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.82,0:18:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不会是里奇蒙德的鲍勃弗格森吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not Bob Ferguson of Richmond?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.68,0:18:36.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他也记得你 医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He remembers you too Doctor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.42,0:18:37.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们在橄榄球场上结识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from the rugby field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.91,0:18:39.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他也许是最好的三分卫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Possibly the finest three-quarter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.55,0:18:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过不曾为英格兰出赛过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}never to have been capped for England.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.18,0:18:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就是这样看的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And my sentiments precisely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.14,0:18:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我热爱这项运动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love the game and{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.53,0:18:53.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毫不谦虚地说 我曾经打得不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if modesty permits I once turned out myself quite a player.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.63,0:18:59.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}鲍勃在国外工作了很多年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well Bob has spent much most of his working life abroad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:19:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}做棉花贸易{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cotton brooking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.61,0:19:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他跟他前妻生了一个孩子叫杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now his first wife,by whom he has a son Jack,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.81,0:19:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几年前他妻子死于高烧…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she died of fever some years ago and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.03,0:19:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瞧 我觉得很有必要让你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Iook it's absolutely essential{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.60,0:19:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}了解事情的全貌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I put you in the full picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.26,0:19:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就这样接着讲下去吧 牧师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Continue just as you're doing Reverend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.24,0:19:19.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯经常是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is often Holmes' method{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.91,0:19:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}紧闭着双眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to absorb all{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.97,0:19:25.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把所有的细节都听进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}relevant detail with his eyes tight shut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.05,0:19:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}鲍勃最近回到了家乡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well Bob arrived home recently{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.63,0:19:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带了一位从秘鲁来的新娘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with a new bride{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.99,0:19:37.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和他们襁褓中的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and a baby from Peru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.43,0:19:39.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于所有有关的人来说 都是一场艰难的改变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Difficult transition for all concerned{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.41,0:19:41.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个你想象得到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as you may imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.30,0:19:56.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会骑马吗 杰克？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You ride Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.90,0:19:58.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 不会 - 他当然会了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- No. - Of course he rides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.50,0:20:00.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是我教的呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I taught him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.27,0:20:02.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有的事情都是我教给你的 对吧杰克？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Taught you everything didn't I Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.39,0:20:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过我得让你注意一位陌生人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I must turn your attention to a stranger{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.17,0:20:07.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在这一家从秘鲁回来前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who came into our midst not long{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.64,0:20:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他先来到了我们这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before our Peruvian family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.97,0:20:12.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他叫约翰 斯托克顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His name is John Stockton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.54,0:20:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 起初我很欢迎他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well at first I welcomed him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.11,0:20:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把他当作是一个知识分子 一个作家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as a man of intellect,a writer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.39,0:20:18.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个能给我们小小的社区带来生机的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and stimulus to our little community.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.01,0:20:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.47,0:20:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不能说我个人对他有什么好感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't say that I warmed to him personally{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.39,0:20:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过对于我这样一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but he did have his own appeal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.89,0:20:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}窝在穷乡僻壤的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to someone like myself,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.35,0:20:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的确有着吸引力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}buried in the backwater.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.30,0:20:35.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他对我虽然不具什么威胁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was not threat to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.95,0:20:38.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}却让当地人颇为不安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but he upset the locals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.44,0:20:40.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的铁匠卡特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}our blacksmith,Carter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.63,0:20:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和他就一个车轮起了争执{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Some argument over a wheel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.28,0:20:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你以为你是谁 敢跑来告诉我该怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who are you come telling me my job{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.39,0:20:45.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你这该死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}damn you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.06,0:20:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要是不喜欢它 就把它带走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you don't like it you can take it away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.28,0:20:49.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另请高明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Find somebody else!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.92,0:20:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你跟它一起滚 别再回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And take yourself with it and don't come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.98,0:20:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们这个村子不欢迎你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We don't want you here in this village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.78,0:20:56.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里没人欢迎你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}None of us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.15,0:21:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卡特正值壮年 彪悍得像头狮子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Carter,a lion of a man in the prime of life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.31,0:21:19.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}乡村生活造就了他强壮的体格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stalwart of village life,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.54,0:21:23.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}结果当下就死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}dead within moments of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.78,0:21:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我教区有一个老小姐叫鲁多克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now Miss Ruddock,spinster of my parish,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.39,0:21:30.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的农舍正对着斯托克顿的屋子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she has the cottage facing Stockton's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.80,0:21:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她说他是一个不用睡觉的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And she speaks of him as the man who never sleeps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.83,0:21:36.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她很多个晚上都看到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She sees a candle in his window{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.47,0:21:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他屋里彻夜点着蜡烛直到天亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}many a nights through till dawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.11,0:21:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 作家在晚上写作 也不算稀奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well writers work it's not uncommon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.32,0:21:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Possibly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.04,0:21:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过我自己因为失眠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I myself am something of an insomniac also{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.57,0:21:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也曾有两次 深夜在墓地里见过他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have seen him twice in my graveyard at dead of night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.27,0:21:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是怎么解释的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And his explanation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.18,0:21:57.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.15,0:21:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你肯定提起过这件事吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Surely you raised the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.03,0:22:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}解释吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Explanation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.62,0:22:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看似可信吧 我想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Plausible I suppose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.21,0:22:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想我跟一家叫辛克莱的有些亲戚关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe that I'm related to a family called Sinclair,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.19,0:22:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它正是我的中间名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}indeed my middle name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.65,0:22:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}辛克莱？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sinclair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.21,0:22:20.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们在村子的那一头有一栋大房子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They had a large house up beyond the village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.65,0:22:24.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 你这么说我想起来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes now you mention it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.62,0:22:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很奇怪在这里找不到任何他们的踪迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm puzzled to find no trace of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.11,0:22:32.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难道我们在这里不受欢迎吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are we not welcome here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.75,0:22:33.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其实不是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No the truth was{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.93,0:22:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实是我很清楚辛克莱一家的故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I knew full well the story of the Sinclair's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.65,0:22:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们是很有权势的地主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They were powerful landowners,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.57,0:22:41.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}整个村子都是他们的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}had the village in their pocket{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.13,0:22:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大概是上个世纪的事情了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}sometime in the last century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.26,0:22:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}辛克莱本人是个残忍的怪物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Lord Sinclair himself was a cruel monster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.98,0:22:52.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些招惹他的人不是失踪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Those who incurred his displeasure disappeared{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.40,0:22:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是被人割断了喉咙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or were found with their throats cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.14,0:22:58.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}年轻的女仆中有一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Young servant girls,one in particular,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.51,0:23:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怀着孩子被遗弃在教堂门口 奄奄一息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was left pregnant and dying at the church door,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.62,0:23:05.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的孩子生下来就死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}her child stillborn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.48,0:23:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个姓辛克莱的都找不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's not a Sinclair to be found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.72,0:23:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们做了什么让人如此憎恨的事情？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What did we do to offend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.92,0:23:15.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有没有告诉他？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you tell him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.41,0:23:18.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 说了个大概{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well the bare bones of it yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.16,0:23:19.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那起教堂事件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The church incident{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.44,0:23:21.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有村民们如何实施了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and how the villagers exacted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.84,0:23:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可怕的复仇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}their terrible revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.74,0:23:27.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把我们的人都烧死了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Burnt us out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.44,0:23:29.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很抱歉这么说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I regret to say,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.35,0:23:31.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然不是针对你本人的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}nothing personal to you of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.96,0:23:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个女孩呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.70,0:23:35.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就埋在那边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's buried over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.93,0:23:42.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是我没有告诉他一件事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But what I neglected to tell him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.63,0:23:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为说了不太合适{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}because it seemed to be inappropriate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.00,0:23:47.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就是辛克莱家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was that the family Sinclair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.88,0:23:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被认为是吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}were deemed to be vampires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.64,0:23:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说的事情都很有意思 牧师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All of this is very interesting Reverend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.52,0:23:55.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过这都是过去的事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As piece of history,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.30,0:23:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟现在又怎么扯上关系了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but how does it lead to the present?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.58,0:23:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 辛克莱自己都承认了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well then Sinclair by his own admission{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.81,0:24:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他回来了 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}has returned hasn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.72,0:24:03.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可对村子又有什么影响呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But how does that affect the village?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.56,0:24:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}村里人干嘛要在乎呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And why should they care?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.61,0:24:07.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有的这些都发生在一百年前啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All of this happened a hundred years back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.91,0:24:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 不过你知道的… 有些传言…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes well...word gets around you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.63,0:24:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是说教堂吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You mean the church?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.47,0:24:15.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}深受流言的影响{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Profound to all gossip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.56,0:24:17.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}回答你的第二个问题吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Answering your second question{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.06,0:24:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个女孩 那个死去的女孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the girl,the dead girl,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.64,0:24:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的后人还生活在这个村子里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}her family is still in the village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.05,0:24:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比如当地旅馆的老板娘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The wife of the landlord of the local inn for instance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.07,0:24:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她就是姓巴罗斯的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she was a Barrows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.54,0:24:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有铁匠的妻子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So too was the blacksmith's wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.42,0:24:39.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}据你所知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Has Stockton,to your knowledge,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.21,0:24:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯托克顿是否进过教堂？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}ever set foot inside the church?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.39,0:24:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 一次也没有  据我所知 从来都没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh no not once as far as I'm aware of it...never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.15,0:24:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既便如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even so,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.27,0:24:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还是不清楚我能帮你什么忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm unclear that I can be of service to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.39,0:24:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}又没有犯下什么罪行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No crime has been committed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.20,0:24:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有罪行？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No crime?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.21,0:24:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的… 没有任何犯罪？但是…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No...no crime? But...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.17,0:25:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还有什么要告诉我们的吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have something more to tell us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.03,0:25:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}四天前… 现在看来像是过了一辈子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}4 days ago now,it seems a lifetime;{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.13,0:25:11.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}鲍勃弗格森邀请斯托克顿去吃饭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bob Ferguson invited Stockton to dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.63,0:25:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道斯托克顿在秘鲁旅行过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You see,Stockton had traveled in Peru{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.03,0:25:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想是我对他提过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I think it was I who suggested{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.12,0:25:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说让他的新太太重新{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that it might be a good thing for his new wife{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.45,0:25:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟自己的故乡建立些联系是件好事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to have some contact again with her native country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.63,0:25:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难道那并非是个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the evening{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.10,0:25:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}成功的夜晚？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not a success?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.22,0:25:30.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我所知道的就是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All I know is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.79,0:25:35.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个晚上结果演变成一场悲剧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that the outcome of it was a tragedy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.34,0:25:36.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在第二天早上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The very next morning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.91,0:25:41.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那家人醒来发现了一件可怕的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the household woke to a terrible discovery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.29,0:25:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个婴孩 里卡多 死在他的小床上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The baby,little Ricardo,lay dead in his cot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.01,0:25:47.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}医生的结论呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the doctor's verdict.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.00,0:25:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}医生找不到任何致死的原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The doctor he could find no reason for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.45,0:25:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有可能的原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No earthly reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.16,0:26:02.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是一场悲剧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tragedy indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.18,0:26:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是晚宴的客人的确没有什么好指责的吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But no blame affixed to the dinner guest surely?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.79,0:26:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是他碰了婴孩的手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But he touched the baby's hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.69,0:26:12.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们就是这么告诉我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So they told me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.30,0:26:15.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瞧 我是个牧师 先生们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look I'm a man of God gentlemen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.08,0:26:16.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我绝对不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and far be it for me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.19,0:26:18.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}单凭谣言或是迷信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to judge a fellow being{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.42,0:26:20.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就对一个人下结论{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}on hearsay and superstition{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.06,0:26:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是我也要考虑我的教民们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I also have my parishioners to think of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.39,0:26:24.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们都吓得要命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and their frightened{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.92,0:26:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们将会采取非法律途径{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and they will take steps outside the law{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.32,0:26:28.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来把他赶出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to drive him out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.85,0:26:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像以前对待他的祖先那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as they once did his forbearers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.38,0:26:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你明白我的两难境地了吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You see my dilemma?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.19,0:26:35.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么你希望我们进行调查？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So you wish us to make an investigation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.01,0:26:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}调查这个人以及他的为人和生活习惯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}into this man,his personality,his habits?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.57,0:26:44.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以证实大众的担心是毫无理由的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And disprove the common fear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.52,0:26:47.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}证明或是驳斥 随便你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Disprove,disprove what you will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.27,0:26:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要你一出现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're presence alone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.73,0:26:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就能起到安定民心的效果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will have a steadying affect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.39,0:27:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我现在得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well now I must leave you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.90,0:27:02.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还得操心的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Among my other concerns{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.53,0:27:04.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}村里的疾病{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is sickness in the village{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.13,0:27:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且我还得为明天婴儿的葬礼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I have the baby's funeral{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.12,0:27:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}做好准备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to prepare for tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.13,0:27:12.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的故事真复杂 牧师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your story is complex Reverend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.27,0:27:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过却是很有意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But none of that's uninterest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.44,0:27:20.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信应该有合理的解释{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet I'm sure there's a rational explanation for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.62,0:27:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生和我将会到您的教区去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Watson and I will visit your community.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.98,0:27:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 我太高兴了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh I'm so pleased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.21,0:27:31.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您提到了一个旅馆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You mentioned an inn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.77,0:27:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 叫切克斯 是个像样的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes the Checquers,it's a decently run place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.73,0:27:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.95,0:27:38.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我非常地感激{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm so grateful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.41,0:27:40.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}感激你们二位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So grateful to you both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.74,0:27:42.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常感激{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So grateful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.66,0:28:16.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的 两起突然的死亡事件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right,2 sudden deaths,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.82,0:28:18.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}铁匠和婴儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the blacksmith and the child,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.45,0:28:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在和他接触后不久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}shortly after contact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.77,0:28:20.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自然死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Natural causes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.92,0:28:23.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}验尸官的报告会这么说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as the coroner's report will inform us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.70,0:28:25.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯托克顿夜里的习惯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stockton's nocturnal habits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.47,0:28:27.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有窗后的烛光？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the light in the window?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.80,0:28:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}写作不顺罢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Writer's block.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.14,0:28:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他对天黑以后的墓地怀有的病态兴趣？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His morbid interest in graveyards after dark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.92,0:28:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对"病态"这个词我不敢苟同{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I object the word morbid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.28,0:28:38.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是一种动机但并非事实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a motive not fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.75,0:28:40.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好吧 那从不进教堂又怎么说？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right,never entering the church?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.59,0:28:42.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这可是你自己提出来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You raised that point yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.12,0:28:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是似乎从未进过教堂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never seemed to enter the church{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.68,0:28:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是不是因为他没有宗教信仰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and does that make a man a ghoul{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.14,0:28:47.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就可以断定他为盗尸贼？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}because he has no interest in religion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.19,0:28:49.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那在弗格森房子里做客的夜晚呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The evening spent in Ferguson's house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.28,0:28:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}牧师是否在现场？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was the Vicar there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.98,0:28:52.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 不过梅瑞德告诉过我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No but Merridew tells us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.58,0:28:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯托克顿碰了那婴孩的手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that Stockton touched the baby's hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.67,0:28:56.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是你的案子吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is that your case?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.44,0:28:57.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我们到这儿干嘛来了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So what is our mission here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.86,0:28:59.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许是来阻止一次犯罪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Possibly to prevent a crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.32,0:29:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个人的心脏就要被插上木棍了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man having a stake driven through his heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.44,0:29:16.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的时机正合适{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have our timing right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.07,0:29:43.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 我们不能强行闯进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holmes we can scarcely intrude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.84,0:29:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是闯进去 华生 是观察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not intrude Watson,observe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.29,0:30:21.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想知道斯托克顿是不是在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wonder if Stockton's here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.31,0:30:23.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这种场合他不可能会露面的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's hardly likely to show is face on this occasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.67,0:30:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是最近晚宴的客人 还是这家人的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A recent dinner guest,a friend of the family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.49,0:30:28.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这种情形下 不会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the circumstances no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.92,0:30:31.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想你是对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes I'm sure you're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.01,0:30:34.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是我知道他就在不远处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I know he's not far away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.79,0:30:37.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一位女士的儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Man that is born of woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.09,0:30:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只活了短短的一生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}hath but a short time to live{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.73,0:30:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}充满了痛苦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and is full of misery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.89,0:30:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他像彗星般掠过 又如花朵般夭折{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He cometh up and is cut down like a flower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.48,0:30:50.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他像个影子般匆匆而过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He fleeth as it were a shadow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.15,0:30:54.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就再也没有留下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A never continueth in one's stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.39,0:30:57.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在生命的旅途中 我们陷入死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the midst of life we are in death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.83,0:31:02.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了您 我们还可以向谁求助呢 我们的主啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of whom may we seek for succor but of thee O' Lord{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.39,0:31:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您应该为我们的罪过而恼怒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who for our sins are justly displeased{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.97,0:31:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们谦恭地恳求您 主啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we meekly beseech the O' Father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.89,0:31:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把我们从罪的死亡中解救出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to raise us from the death of sin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.54,0:31:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}升入正义的九天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}unto the life of righteousness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.32,0:31:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祈求当我们死去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That when we shall depart this life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.85,0:31:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们能在他的怀抱里安息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we may rest in him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.18,0:31:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希望我们的这位教友亦是如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as our hope is this our brother does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.09,0:31:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在最后审判日的复活中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That the general resurrection in the last day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.98,0:31:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们能为您所接受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we may be found acceptable in thy sight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.32,0:31:35.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}得到您的祝福…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and receive that blessing which thy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.59,0:32:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克在八九岁的时候从一棵树上摔了下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack fell from a tree when he was eight or nine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.10,0:32:36.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伤了脊椎骨 可怜的杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Damaged his spine boy oh Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.60,0:32:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But father,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.27,0:32:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那位父亲是在这里还是在国外？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was he here or abroad when it happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.73,0:32:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 我想他当时不在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well I do believe he was away yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.90,0:32:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几乎没有父母亲的童年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A boyhood almost without it's mother or father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.06,0:32:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 在这儿我是他的精神导师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well I was here as his spiritual guardian{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.25,0:32:50.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有梅森太太{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and Mrs. Mason,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.78,0:32:52.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}农场来的女管家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the housekeeper from the farm,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.42,0:32:55.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她把他和她自己的孩子迈克尔一起养大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she brought him up with her own boy Michael.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.75,0:32:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些死亡记录 福尔摩斯 好多人啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These recorded deaths Holmes so many of them,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.40,0:32:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都这么年轻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.82,0:33:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许是流感盛行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An influenza epidemic perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.77,0:33:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像现在一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As we have now upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.70,0:33:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果斯托克顿是一个复仇者的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If Stockton is perceived as some sort of avenger{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.07,0:33:11.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他干嘛要选中弗格森一家？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}why should he light upon the Ferguson's?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.82,0:33:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们的家族一百年前并不在这里啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean they weren't here a hundred years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.94,0:33:17.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即使是现在他们也没有 融入这里的乡村生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even now they're scarcely apart of the village life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.02,0:33:19.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.74,0:33:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们怎么会勾起他的兴趣的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why is he drawn to them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.79,0:33:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个女士 还有跟秘鲁的联系？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The women,the connection with Peru?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.66,0:33:30.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是因为就近选择？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or is it something nearer home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.89,0:33:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你跟本地的医生交上朋友了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you make friends with the local doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.15,0:34:00.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是什么朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hardly friends{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.81,0:34:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他对我颇为猜疑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as I was greeted with deep suspicion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.53,0:34:05.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不得不用我30年前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Had to plead my rugby acquaintanceship{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.51,0:34:08.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟弗格森的橄榄球缘作为借口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with Ferguson that goes back 30 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.77,0:34:10.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在老迪尔公园球场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He threw me over the ropes into the crowd{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.59,0:34:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把我扔过了绳栏 扔到了人群中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at the Old Deer Park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.92,0:34:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么解释你的出现？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How do you explain your presence here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.38,0:34:21.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 我觉得我们不会在这里呆很久的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well I cant believe that we'll be detained here long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.18,0:34:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另一份验尸报告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Another coroner's report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.93,0:34:28.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}铁匠卡特死于出血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Blacksmith,Carter,died of a hemorrhage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.13,0:34:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许他看上去是健壮如牛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He may have look robust but he was overweight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.08,0:34:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过他体重超标又喝很多酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and he drank too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.19,0:34:32.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那婴儿呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.37,0:34:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}记录为肺炎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Put down to pneumonia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.18,0:34:35.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有暴力的迹象？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No sign of violence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.22,0:34:36.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.51,0:34:38.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟我们想的一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just as we thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.17,0:34:39.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在去拜访弗格森如何？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What now a visit to Ferguson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.41,0:34:40.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以示尊敬？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pay our respects?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.23,0:34:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.85,0:34:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我饿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.87,0:34:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.79,0:35:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where's Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.98,0:35:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是在下面跟你在一起吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is he down with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.23,0:35:21.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.48,0:35:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从下午到现在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I haven't seen sight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.33,0:35:24.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有看见过他也没有听到他的声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}nor sound of him since this afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.85,0:35:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}葬礼之后他没有回来过吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He didn't come back here after the funeral?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.56,0:35:29.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我问问迈克尔看他是否见到过他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll ask Michael if he's seen him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.68,0:35:30.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.00,0:35:32.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是给弗格森太太的吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is that for Mrs. Ferguson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.56,0:35:33.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 鸡汤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,chicken broth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.02,0:35:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她得吃点东西才行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She must eat something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.31,0:35:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我拿上去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll take it up to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.95,0:35:39.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 管家太太{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you my lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.21,0:35:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要吃的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.19,0:35:59.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她睡着了 先生 别吵醒她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's sleep now sir,no wake her up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.60,0:36:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个我来做主 多洛雷斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll decide that Dolores.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.83,0:36:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.66,0:36:42.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别碰我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't touch me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.98,0:36:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.78,0:37:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还要我拿点别的吗 先生们？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anything more I can get you gentlemen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.76,0:37:44.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个太棒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is excellent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.98,0:37:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要了 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.26,0:37:48.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一杯水 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Glass of water thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.76,0:37:50.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们都看见你了 迈克尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were seen Michael.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.19,0:37:53.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们就是看见你了 不承认也没用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes you were and there's no denying it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.53,0:37:55.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}整个仪式中都抓着你的胳膊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Clutching your arm right through that service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.82,0:37:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是我干的 维拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It wasn't my doing Vera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.38,0:37:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她很沉痛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She was grieving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.77,0:38:00.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}需要一个男人的支撑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She needed the support of a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.03,0:38:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就因为她是外国来的还很漂亮吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just cause she's foreign and beautiful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.51,0:38:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不像你一样会骑马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not ride a horse like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.11,0:38:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 骑马又怎么啦？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh what's it matter riding horses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.58,0:38:11.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我肯定你亲了她了 我了解你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I bet you kissed her knowing you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.25,0:38:12.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲她？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kissed her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.40,0:38:14.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是那样的话我的下巴都会被打碎的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd get my jaw broken with that one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.38,0:38:15.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她脾气暴躁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's fiery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.63,0:38:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不就喜欢那样的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's just how you like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.02,0:38:18.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.55,0:38:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像你一样全身羽毛都竖起来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All ruffled feathers my dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.47,0:38:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 来吧 我们到外面去 - 不要 走开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Come on let's step outside.. - No get off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.08,0:38:26.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 噢 来吧 - 不 迈克尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Oh come one. - No Michael!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.72,0:38:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我今晚不舒服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not feeling very well tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.55,0:38:41.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.86,0:38:46.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这牛排和腰子布丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This steak and kidney pudding{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.32,0:38:48.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}果然名副其实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is every bit as good as it's reputation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.09,0:38:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不觉得吗 华生？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}wouldn't you say Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.18,0:38:51.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 名副其实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes every bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.88,0:38:55.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在贝克街可是出了名啊 格雷斯蒂太太{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're famous in Beggar Street Mrs. Gresty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.81,0:38:57.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的管家 哈德森太太{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our housekeeper Mrs. Hudson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.33,0:38:58.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}向我们推荐了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}put us onto you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.07,0:39:00.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森太太？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mrs. Hudson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.98,0:39:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她有个妹妹住在这儿附近{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She has a sister who lives near by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.17,0:39:04.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.05,0:39:07.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 你要夸就夸我先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well it's my husband you have to compliment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.73,0:39:10.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}东西主要都是他煮的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's him who does the cooking mostly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.33,0:39:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么你就是歇洛克 福尔摩斯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So you are Sherlock Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.49,0:39:14.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听候您差遣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At your service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.33,0:39:15.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们来这儿办案的吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On a case there are ya?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.89,0:39:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 这里肯定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh surely there is no crime{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.67,0:39:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有什么罪案的啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in this part of the country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.31,0:39:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请我们的男主人喝上一杯 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Drinks for our host Watson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.15,0:39:32.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也请大伙儿喝一杯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}drinks all around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.15,0:39:38.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.55,0:39:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 华生医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh Doctor Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.74,0:39:43.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是弗格森先生以前的一位橄榄球友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is an old rugby-playing friend of Mr. Ferguson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.45,0:39:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对他和他的家人来说这事儿真够惨的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a tragedy about him and his family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.08,0:39:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你想跟迈克尔谈谈吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You want to talk to Michael about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.79,0:39:53.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们发现那可怜的孩子时他就在那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was there when they found the poor mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.36,0:39:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那也不是什么意外死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And it wasn't no accidental death neither.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.39,0:39:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别的什么都有可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whatever else it was{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.89,0:40:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}唯独不是一起意外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it wasn't no accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.82,0:40:21.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克你去哪儿了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack where've you been?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.23,0:40:23.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was worried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.63,0:40:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我以为你想跟卡洛塔独处一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought you'd want to be alone with Carlotta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.00,0:40:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我需要你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I needed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.19,0:40:34.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此刻我需要我们像一家人那样团结在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I needed us together as a family this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.89,0:40:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们所有人在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All of us together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.80,0:41:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您是对的 牧师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are right Reverend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.61,0:41:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}空气中弥漫着一种危险的气氛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is a dangerous mood in the air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.49,0:41:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是并没有任何对斯托克顿不利的证据{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But no fresh evidence against Stockton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.59,0:41:44.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这种巧合还是让我无法平静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm still struck by the coincidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.80,0:41:48.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 回答我的这个问题 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well answer me this Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.61,0:41:50.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是真没什么的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why is so much being written and recorded{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.84,0:41:52.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么还有那么多记载{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}on the subject of vampires{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.68,0:41:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是关于吸血鬼的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if there's absolutely nothing in it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.42,0:41:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是人类的需要 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Man's need Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.57,0:41:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出于对恐惧的解释的需要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His need to explain fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.83,0:42:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么你承认有些事情是无法解释的了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then you do admit to the inexplicable?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.02,0:42:03.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 有非常多的证据表明这点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well yes there's plenty evidence of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.66,0:42:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是你是否会因为有很多人写过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But do you believe in dragons{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.57,0:42:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就相信有龙的存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and fairies and ghosts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.69,0:42:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还相信仙女和鬼？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}because much has been written about them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.98,0:42:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}鬼？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ghosts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.27,0:42:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生有个鬼故事要讲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Watson has a ghost story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.81,0:42:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是说这个的时候 老兄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not now man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.37,0:42:18.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 说吧  华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No carry on Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.77,0:42:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当时我在阿富汗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was in Afghanistan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.54,0:42:22.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}经历了许多疲劳的长夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Long nights of fatigue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.42,0:42:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在一个战地医院里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In a field hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.06,0:42:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一个年轻中尉死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A young subaltern,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.69,0:42:28.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实上他就死在我的怀里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who had died,virtually in my arms,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.99,0:42:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在他过世的几周后 我在伊斯坦布尔休假{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}appeared some weeks later quite unmistakably{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.05,0:42:34.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他分明就出现在了那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when I was on leave in Constantinople.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.68,0:42:36.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真有意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fascinating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.13,0:43:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gentleman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.45,0:43:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}歇洛克 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.70,0:43:04.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}久仰 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes of course Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.05,0:43:06.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有华生医生 我想你认识他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Dr. Watson I believe you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.48,0:43:08.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 亲爱的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Watson,my dear fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.88,0:43:10.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请进 请进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come inside,come inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.72,0:43:12.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的朋友 谨致以诚挚的哀悼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My dear chap I sincere condolences...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.51,0:43:13.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.45,0:43:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}梅森小姐 为客人上咖啡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Coffee for our guest Miss Mason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.26,0:43:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都准备好了 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's ready and waiting sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.01,0:43:23.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的难得的好管家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My treasured housekeeper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.85,0:43:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是没有她我们都不知道怎么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We'd be lost without her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.64,0:43:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 请坐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh sit down please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.73,0:43:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}奥古斯都向我解释了你们来这儿的原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Augustus has explained your presence here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.96,0:43:36.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我非常认同他的主动帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and heartily endorse his initiative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.60,0:43:38.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是个悲惨的时刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This has been wretched time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.31,0:43:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不只是对我和我的家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not just for me and my family{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.56,0:43:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于整个社区而言也一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but for the whole community.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.66,0:43:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们越快弄明白越好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The sooner we make sense of it the better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.30,0:43:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的爱妻呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your dear wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.52,0:43:51.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我本来很想要她也到场的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes I would have liked for her to be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.51,0:43:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她在楼上自己的房间里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's upstairs in her room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.75,0:43:57.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你见过斯托克顿了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you met Stockton yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.55,0:44:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还未有幸会面 弗格森先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We've not had that pleasure Mr. Ferguson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.23,0:44:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有幸？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pleasure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.56,0:44:04.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 是的 我第一次认识他的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh yes he seemed he was pleasant enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.68,0:44:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他似乎是个令人愉快的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}on my first acquaintance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.83,0:44:09.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以问你问题吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I ask you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.09,0:44:10.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您随便问 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ask anything Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.90,0:44:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}问什么都行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.00,0:44:18.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在某种程度上我们是不是把你孩子的死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are we some way holding Stockton responsible{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.09,0:44:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}归咎于斯托克顿了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for your child's death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.67,0:44:25.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许在某种程度上我们都要负上些责任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps were all responsible to some degree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.53,0:44:27.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然我妻子责怪我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Certainly my wife holds me responsible{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.46,0:44:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把她带到英国来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for bringing her here to England.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.20,0:44:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小孩还不满一岁 还有气候 欧洲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The child not a year old,the climate,Europe,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.67,0:44:42.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许我盼着能通过归咎于他人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}perhaps I'm looking to alleviate responsibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.48,0:44:44.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来减轻些自己的责任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By directing it at another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.02,0:44:50.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请你原谅我的坦率{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please you must excuse my frankness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.13,0:44:53.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但如果想要弄清问题的实质 我们则很有必要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But it is necessary that we confront the truth about ourselves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.91,0:44:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}面对我们真实的内心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if we are to reach the heart of this matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.66,0:44:59.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你一点也没错 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your absolutely right Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.44,0:45:01.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实的真相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The truth of the matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.56,0:45:03.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能不能跟我们说说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Could you bring yourself to tell us about{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.33,0:45:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯托克顿来用餐的那个晚上？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the evening Stockton came over to dinner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.14,0:45:07.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想那晚你开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which I understand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.50,0:45:10.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对他充满疑虑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was the start of your misgivings about him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.28,0:45:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.05,0:45:15.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那天晚上… 那时我自己也不是很明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That night I didn't see it clearly myself at the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.66,0:45:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚餐平安无事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dinner had passed uneventfully{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.24,0:45:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然我得承认{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}though I confess{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.56,0:45:23.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对我的客人有些失望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was somewhat disappointed by our guest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.90,0:45:25.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的行为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His demeanor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.98,0:45:28.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}灵魂的本性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The real nature of the soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.97,0:45:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到底是什么呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well what is it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.23,0:45:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于某些人而言它只不过是意愿的体现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to some merely a manifestation of the will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.67,0:45:42.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是灵魂会回归造物主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But the soul returns to God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.57,0:45:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像一个声音在空气中消失无踪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Like a sound that vanishes in the air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.01,0:45:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以在某种程度上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So for degrees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.55,0:45:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哲人说生即是死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Life is death say the philosopher's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.58,0:45:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不是很明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I'm afraid I don't follow that,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.98,0:45:58.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是说你不信仰上帝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you saying you don't believe in God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.61,0:46:01.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}印加人当然是信仰太阳神的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Incas of course were sun worshippers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.43,0:46:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个你们都很清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as you seem to know well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.06,0:46:06.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是基于气象的原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The reason was meteorological{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.46,0:46:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夜里没有太阳 作为山地的居民{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}without sun at night being mountain dwellers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.35,0:46:12.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们会冷得发抖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they shiver,they freeze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.96,0:46:15.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}住在海边的人呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What about those on the coast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.00,0:46:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太阳是永恒不变的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The sun was constant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.19,0:46:24.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是天上的暴君{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A tyrant in the sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.71,0:46:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以他们崇拜的是相对小一些的神明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And so it was the lesser god they worshiped,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.13,0:46:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}月亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.03,0:46:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}月宫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The house of the moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.53,0:46:36.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小孩被拿去祭月{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The young children were sacrificed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.90,0:46:39.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}躺在五颜六色的羽绒和棉花床上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lying on beds of colored wool and cotton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.82,0:46:41.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.94,0:46:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么要把小孩当作祭品？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why must the children be sacrificed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.32,0:46:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 不只是小孩 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well not just the children Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.41,0:46:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当部落酋长死去的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When the chieftain died{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.07,0:46:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}习俗就是让他最心爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it was customary to bury him with{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.87,0:46:54.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最漂亮的女人一起陪葬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the most beautiful and best loved women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.93,0:46:58.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天哪 他的妻子吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good God his wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.23,0:47:01.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的妻子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.64,0:47:05.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有他最心爱的妾氏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His favorite concubines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.08,0:47:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或多或少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And a considerable number more or less{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.27,0:47:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有数量可观的仆人 珠宝 天然的银子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of his servants,His jewels,raw silver,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.86,0:47:18.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}僧侣 武器 食物和衣服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Iamas,weapons,food and clothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.28,0:47:23.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以在他的哲学里 死即是生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So in his philosophy death was life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.77,0:47:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然了 为什么不是呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But of course why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.80,0:47:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那种气氛持续了好几个小时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It continued in that vein for hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.93,0:47:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}各种各样的玄虚的理论{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All kinds of mysticism.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.61,0:47:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大都是我无法理解的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mostly beyond my comprehension.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.94,0:47:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马洛巴的寡妇们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The widows of Malobar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.55,0:47:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在她们的丈夫遗体火化的烈焰中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Burnt themselves in the blaze{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.25,0:47:42.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自焚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the remains of their husbands{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.85,0:47:45.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以示忠诚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as a demonstration of fidelity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.85,0:47:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我无法描述的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What I can't describe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.42,0:47:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的话对在场的人的影响{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is the effect it had on the company,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.33,0:47:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特别是女士们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the ladies in particular.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.84,0:47:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就好像他给她们施了催眠术一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was if he had them mesmerized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.94,0:48:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有在他离开之后 卡洛塔…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yet after he left,Carlotta...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.37,0:48:07.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他真是令人厌恶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was repulsive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.97,0:48:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你觉得他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You found him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.43,0:48:11.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}令人厌恶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Repulsive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.27,0:48:13.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不想我们再见到他吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'd rather we didn't see him again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.15,0:48:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是你的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's your friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.70,0:48:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.38,0:48:24.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第二天早上之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The following morning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.27,0:48:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就从此成了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}hence subsequently{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.98,0:48:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她发泄痛苦的对象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I became the object of her pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.87,0:48:33.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是斯托克顿和你的孩子的死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But the connection with Stockton{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.51,0:48:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}之间的联系呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and your baby's death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.07,0:48:36.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是说 如你所述{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean as you describe the evening{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.81,0:48:38.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两者之间很难形成什么联系啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it's hard to forge a link.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.96,0:48:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道 可是从那晚上起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know but it all went wrong Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.54,0:48:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一切就都不对劲了 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from that evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.04,0:48:50.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}屋子里就像笼罩着一团乌云…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This house was if there was a black cloud...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.18,0:48:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我无法描述 我真希望我能说得清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't describe it I wish to God I could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.52,0:48:55.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有那么多的巧合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's so many coincidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.64,0:49:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.34,0:49:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我的儿子 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My son,Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.59,0:49:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过来见见我的朋友们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come and meet my friends,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.66,0:49:06.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生医生和福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dr. Watson and Mr. Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.66,0:49:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我打扰你们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm interrupting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.43,0:49:11.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克 你丝毫没有打扰我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack you're not interrupting at all{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.63,0:49:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过来坐下跟我们谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}now come and sit down and talk to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.44,0:49:16.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}音乐怎么样了 杰克？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How's the music Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.31,0:49:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还在练习小提琴吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You still practicing the violin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.30,0:49:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克得到了一把新的小提琴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack's been given a new violin,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.60,0:49:23.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是他继母给他的礼物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a gift from his stepmother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.16,0:49:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}旧的那把音色不错啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The old one plays rather well,usually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.88,0:49:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯也会拉小提琴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holmes plays the violin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.82,0:49:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等你继母完全康复了 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I look forward to meeting your stepmother Jack{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.51,0:49:32.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很想见见她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when she's sufficiently recovered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.68,0:49:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.14,0:49:36.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们看看现在合不合适吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well let us see if now is not the moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.71,0:49:38.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}梅森太太 麻烦你到楼上去一下好吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mrs. Mason would you go upstairs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.50,0:49:42.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 她不在房间里 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh she's not in her room sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.79,0:49:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她很早就出去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She went out early.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.70,0:49:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不在吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.09,0:49:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么没告诉我？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well why didn't you tell me this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.55,0:49:48.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 我以为你知道呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well I thought you knew?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.01,0:49:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她们两个都出去了 父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They both went out father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.34,0:49:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}单独出去吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.49,0:49:53.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯托克顿先生来接她们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Stockton came for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.95,0:49:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是来关心她们的 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He came to pay his respects sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.85,0:49:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是你在外头骑马的时候 父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When you were out riding father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.46,0:50:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看见她们跟他一起走了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you saw them leave with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.58,0:50:03.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的妻子和女仆？自愿的吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My wife and the maid willingly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.67,0:50:04.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们俩都看见了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You both witnessed this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.99,0:50:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 他们说就去兜一下风{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh just for a short drive they said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.70,0:50:10.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到户外去 让她们的脸色红润起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To take the air,put color in their cheeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.97,0:50:21.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真的该让我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I really should have been informed of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.81,0:50:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的妻子还不太舒服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My wife is not herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.51,0:50:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是斯托克顿先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was it Mr. Stockton{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.87,0:50:26.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说服她去兜什么愚蠢的风吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who persuaded her on this foolish drive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.81,0:50:28.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是谁鼓动的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who instigated it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.20,0:50:29.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么这么担心呢 父亲？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why does it worry you father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.94,0:50:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}三个都没事 弗格森先生 他们回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All's well Mr. Ferguson,they're coming home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.73,0:50:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯托克顿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stockton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.07,0:51:01.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道你要来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I didn't realize you had come by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.91,0:51:03.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你本该告诉我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wish you would have told me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.85,0:51:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女士们怎么样了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How are the ladies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.38,0:51:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.81,0:51:09.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们在乡间兜了一圈 很愉快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We had a pleasant drive through the countryside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.17,0:51:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}空气清新{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The air is fresh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.85,0:51:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.76,0:51:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他真够有胆量的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nerve of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.31,0:51:47.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么你并无偏见了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You keep an open mind then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.31,0:51:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}全然违背逻辑 我想是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Against all logic I suppose yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.36,0:51:53.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那歇洛克 福尔摩斯呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Sherlock Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.67,0:51:56.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在英国的犯罪领域中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Such things do not happen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.70,0:51:57.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还不曾发生过这样的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in criminal practice in England.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.80,0:52:03.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有僵尸走过这片土地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The notion of the undead walking this earth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.28,0:52:05.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拿无辜的妇女们饱餐一顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}feasting off innocent females{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.99,0:52:09.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这种想法违背了他的理性认知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}offends against all his reasoning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.34,0:52:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为一名神职人员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is your own view Reverend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.71,0:52:13.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您的看法是什么 牧师？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as a man of the church?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.61,0:52:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}生与死都是神秘的 医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Life and death are mysterious states doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.10,0:52:21.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们对两者的力量都知之甚少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We know little of the resources of either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.95,0:52:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卡洛塔 亲爱的 开门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Carlotta my darling open the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.71,0:52:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卡洛塔 请你开门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Carlotta open the door please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.94,0:52:38.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卡洛塔 开门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Carlotta open the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.98,0:53:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.86,0:53:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.65,0:54:03.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 本地的医生病倒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holmes the local doctor has taken his bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.46,0:54:04.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这儿似乎需要我的服务了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems my services are called for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.63,0:54:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望不是传染病{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hope its not catching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.84,0:54:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是的 我从来不会得传染病{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No I never catch anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.86,0:54:09.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在忙什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you up to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.45,0:54:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的第一次出诊是去看旅馆老板的女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My first call's the daughter at the inn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.40,0:54:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她病得不轻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's not at all well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.67,0:54:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}葬礼之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He took the crippled boy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.08,0:54:19.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他把那瘸腿的男孩带到他的房子里头去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}into his house after the funeral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.43,0:54:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}整个下午都在他房子里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All afternoon in his house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.07,0:54:23.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那男孩子六点钟才回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the boy didn't come back till six o'clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.05,0:54:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她不会死吧 医生？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's not going to die is she doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.89,0:54:52.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不会的 但会经历一个危险期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No but she will pass through a crisis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.84,0:54:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她需要最悉心的照料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And needs the greatest care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.26,0:54:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在该让她睡觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She should sleep now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.68,0:54:59.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个村子瘟疫流行了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This village is plagued.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.16,0:55:02.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像其他许多村庄一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Like many another at this time of the year{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.56,0:55:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一年中这个时候总会有流感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with influenza.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.83,0:55:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你这肮脏丑陋的混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You dirty filthy bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.36,0:55:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you doing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.20,0:55:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你以为我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You think I couldn't see you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.52,0:55:26.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你和维拉就要完了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With Vera lying at deaths door?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.65,0:55:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}维拉？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vera?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.49,0:55:30.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别假装你不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't pretend you didn't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.54,0:55:33.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她才是你的女人 迈克尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's your girl Michael{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.80,0:55:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是那个外国来的渣滓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not that foreign trash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.15,0:55:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.59,0:55:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}妈妈 别哭了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mom don't cry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.02,0:55:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自从他们来到这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ever since they come here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.59,0:55:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就只有麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there's nothing but trouble{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.82,0:55:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁知道那个人带来了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and what with him know that man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.00,0:55:47.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哪个人？斯托克顿先生吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What man,Mr. Stockton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.42,0:55:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他会把所有人都杀死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's killing everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.28,0:55:51.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}迈克尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Michael.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.67,0:56:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.37,0:56:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是一种特权{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is a privilege.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.83,0:56:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们出去逛逛吧 这么个温和的夜晚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's stroll out I think on such a balmy evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.40,0:56:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在村子里逛吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the village?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.64,0:56:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有马车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have my carriage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.62,0:56:36.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}乡间 多么令人愉快啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The countryside how delightful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.11,0:57:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你为什么…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So why are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.28,0:57:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到这儿来？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.00,0:57:18.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了我的健康{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For my health.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.66,0:57:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在一个被死亡和阴暗笼罩的乡村？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In village riddled with death and gloom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.45,0:57:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过不是被犯罪所笼罩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But no crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.03,0:57:24.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会把手放在胸口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will lay your hand on your heart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.19,0:57:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发誓你不是来调查我的吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and say your not investigating me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.22,0:57:27.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么了？你干了什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why what have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.65,0:57:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会有几个人告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are several who will tell you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.92,0:57:30.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我被认为做过什么还有我是干什么的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what I'm alleged to have done,and what I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.59,0:57:33.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}坏天使 死神的先驱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bad angel precursor of death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.95,0:57:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}流言不是真相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No truth in the rumor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.32,0:57:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只是在过我的日子 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm living my life Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.37,0:57:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个人还能干什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What more does a man do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.33,0:57:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你教小提琴吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You teach the violin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.56,0:57:43.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克？是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack? Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.12,0:57:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 但那不是... - 我的主业？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- But that is not... - My main occupation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.24,0:57:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.72,0:57:48.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我研究古代习俗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I study antiquities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.24,0:57:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}南美印第安人的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Religious cults and customs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.83,0:57:51.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宗教祭祀仪式和风俗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}among the South American Indians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.21,0:57:55.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在那个领域我是小有名气的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a modest reputation in that field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.57,0:57:56.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出版过什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Published?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.25,0:57:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两本书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}2 books.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.09,0:58:00.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你对我的研究领域熟悉吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're familiar with my subjects?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.34,0:58:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我到东方旅行过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My travels took me East.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.15,0:58:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}西藏吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tibet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.18,0:58:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在则是宁静的英国乡村了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And now the quiet of English countryside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.46,0:58:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在对家族的历史做些小小的溯源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm tracing a little family history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.53,0:58:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里是你家族原来的居住地吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is your family home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.25,0:58:18.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}辛克莱大人的领地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The seat of Lord Sinclair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.66,0:58:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}村里人都觉得我的祖先们是吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The villages believe my forbearers were vampires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.46,0:58:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}某一起与村里的少女们有关的事件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Some incident involving one of their maidens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.02,0:58:31.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}珍妮特 巴罗斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Janet Barrows,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.26,0:58:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你曾带了一朵玫瑰去了她的墓地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}whose grave you were at with a rose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.92,0:58:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你很善于观察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Observant of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.85,0:58:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们烧了这座房子 肆无忌惮的复仇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They burnt this house an act of unbridled revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.76,0:58:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而现在他们都在愧疚中煎熬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And now they suffer from the guilty fear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.93,0:58:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}唯恐我回来惩罚他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I've come back to punish them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.59,0:58:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是否就是你的目的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is that your purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.39,0:58:50.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毫无意义的担忧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What a pointless exercise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.26,0:58:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来吧 我带你到处看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come let me show you around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.81,0:58:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我跟你一样 是来调查的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am like yourself,an investigator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.09,0:59:01.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以跟我说说你的发现吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I share your findings?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.88,0:59:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.72,0:59:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想听听你的看法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want your opinion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.60,0:59:08.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在你看来 世上是否有吸血鬼存在？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do vampires exist in your philosophy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.32,0:59:12.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以人的形式存在嘛 也许有的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In human terms perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.72,0:59:15.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么你现在看到的是不是一只吸血鬼呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And are you looking at one now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.36,0:59:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这座房子从前肯定散发着糜乐的气息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From this house must have emanated one spoiled from conviviality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.61,0:59:27.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也许就是回来重拾这种气息的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I may come back to restore it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.27,0:59:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}乡村生活对我来说甚为无趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Life in the village holds few delights for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.79,0:59:41.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你为什么要把弗格森太太带到这儿来？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why did you bring Mrs. Ferguson here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.14,1:00:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不  不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.40,1:00:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯托克顿  怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stockton what is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.81,1:01:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我… 我… 我是…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I...I...I'm...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.96,1:01:08.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.40,1:01:10.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你够不够朋友？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you a friend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.39,1:01:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.41,1:01:12.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是你的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.16,1:01:14.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不能告诉任何活着的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot tell a living soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.62,1:01:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.28,1:01:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.02,1:01:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.15,1:01:18.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不能说什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What can't you tell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.44,1:01:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}死亡女神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mistress Death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.40,1:01:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她和我们在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She is with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.99,1:01:29.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她贪得无厌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}insatiable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.70,1:01:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让她离我远远的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Keep her away from me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.55,1:02:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.76,1:02:11.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我妻子把门栓死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my wife has bolted her door,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.94,1:02:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的儿子杰克又不理我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my boy Jack has banished me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.87,1:02:15.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}村民们怎么样了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How fares the village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.25,1:02:18.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 药物会治好他们的病{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh medicine should cure their ills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.16,1:02:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你妻子发烧吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does your wife have a fever?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.28,1:02:20.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我看看她吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me visit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.86,1:02:23.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她所得的病非药物可以治疗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What she has is beyond medicine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.93,1:02:26.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它占据了她的灵魂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's taken charge of her soul,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.67,1:02:28.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}深入骨髓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}her very bones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.83,1:02:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是悲伤吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it not grief?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.81,1:02:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是的 我知道悲伤是什么样子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No I recognize grief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.95,1:02:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我理解悲伤的感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I understand grief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.07,1:02:38.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是某种毒害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is some other poison{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.81,1:02:41.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们都知道它是从哪儿来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and we know its source you and I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.14,1:02:46.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我该怎么做呢 华生？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What am I to do Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.28,1:02:48.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}袖手旁观 让他把我们所有人都毁掉吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just stand aside and it him destroy all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.06,1:02:49.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}放松些 老朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Easy old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.59,1:02:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯怎么看？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What does Holmes make of it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.26,1:02:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他觉得我们都疯了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does he think were all mad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.66,1:03:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我见到了一个鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've seen a ghost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.76,1:03:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That I don't believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.29,1:03:25.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你见过？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.86,1:03:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}鬼是不会让你感兴趣的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It didn't appear to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.06,1:03:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个鬼就会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This one did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.91,1:03:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}表面看上去是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Appear so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.28,1:03:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}似乎我太接近了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems I got too close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.73,1:03:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太接近什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Too close to what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.82,1:03:40.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}迟些时候再解释{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll explain later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.42,1:03:41.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那女孩怎么样了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How's the girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.88,1:03:43.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 她会康复{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh she'll recover{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.24,1:03:45.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有比流感更险恶的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it's nothing more sinister than influenza.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.89,1:03:47.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}似乎年轻人之中流感爆发得特别厉害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems to have struck the young in particular.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.15,1:03:49.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}年轻人？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The young?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.48,1:03:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}村里有六个女孩传染上了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Half a dozen young girls of the village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.25,1:03:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}流感吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Influenza?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.52,1:03:53.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}具有所有常见的病症:{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All the usual symptoms:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.32,1:03:56.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夜汗 昏睡  毫无生气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}night sweats,drowsiness,lethargy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.26,1:03:58.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 弗格森在楼下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh Ferguson's downstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.27,1:04:00.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们去会会他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We'll join him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.16,1:04:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}首先我们必须明白这一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}First we must understand this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.20,1:04:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 格雷斯蒂太太{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you Mrs. Gresty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.53,1:04:12.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 非常提神 - 好的 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- most reviving - Yes thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.69,1:04:21.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吸血鬼即使是在传说中 也并非一定是个死人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The vampire. Even the legend was not necessarily a dead man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.54,1:04:26.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}活人也可以做出这样的举动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A living person might attempt such behavior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.01,1:04:29.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是说斯托克顿就是其中一个？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your saying Stockton is one of these creatures?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.62,1:04:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are people we know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.71,1:04:33.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有些人像海绵那样吸食他人的能量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who suck up the energies of others like a sponge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.17,1:04:36.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把他们的活力都吸取出来据为己有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Draw out their resources{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.93,1:04:38.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}使他们虚弱不堪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and pocket them leaving them fatigued.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.11,1:04:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再也无法控制自己的意志{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No longer master of their wills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.07,1:04:44.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是一种心理现象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a psychological phenomenon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.07,1:04:45.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}医生们也都公认这一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doctors have acknowledged it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.61,1:04:48.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 这种人确实存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes they exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.53,1:04:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在某种程度上 你所说的的确符合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What you say does describe in some measure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.82,1:04:53.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与那天晚上他来用餐时的景象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that night he came to dinner{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.67,1:04:58.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有他对卡洛塔与女仆的影响{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the effect he had on Carlotta and the maid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.26,1:05:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}刚才我自己也感受到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had a taste of it myself just now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.48,1:05:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你那撞鬼的经历呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And your ghostly experience?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.91,1:05:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}目前我不相信我所看到的景象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't,for the moment,believe what I saw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.64,1:05:10.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我的确接受了那种幻觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I do accept hallucination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.32,1:05:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另一个人强迫我的心智欺骗了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The mind forced by another to play tricks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.90,1:05:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}催眠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hypnosis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.06,1:05:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯托克顿曾跟南美印第安人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stockton has spent much time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.22,1:05:21.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一起呆过很长的时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with the South American Indians{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.85,1:05:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}研究他们古老的秘密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}studying their ancient mysteries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.57,1:05:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他很有可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's quite possible{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.17,1:05:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在那里学到了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that he learned something out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.62,1:05:33.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}受到一次经历的影响{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was effected by an experience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.36,1:05:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但你并没有因此就证明他无罪吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But you don't exonerate him for that surely?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.09,1:05:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 但他很有可能得了某种病{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No but he could be suffering a form of illness,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.80,1:05:40.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}治疗以后也许会有起色的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which may respond to treatment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.78,1:05:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我们就只能让他滥杀无辜了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And meanwhile we let him run amuck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.90,1:05:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那家伙是很有破坏性的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The man is destructive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.47,1:05:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 你不会否认这一点吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holmes you're not denying that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.34,1:05:48.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我们任由他破坏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's only destructive if we let him be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.80,1:05:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我们相信太多的神话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If we believe too many tales{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.66,1:05:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或者或多或少 把他当成我们内心恶意的载体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or use him as nothing more or less{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.95,1:05:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他才会有破坏性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}than a depository for our own ills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.11,1:06:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是说我就是这么干的吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you suggesting that I am doing that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.84,1:06:02.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想村子里本身就有危机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think there's a danger of it in this village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.60,1:06:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我跟这个村子站在一起 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I stand with this village Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.63,1:06:05.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我住在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I live here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.84,1:06:08.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且我还看到了他对他人造成的直接影响{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I have seen his direct influence over people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.61,1:06:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对我们所爱的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Loved ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.85,1:06:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个无辜的毫无防备能力的婴儿死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A defenseless,innocent baby is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.20,1:06:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你还觉得那是正确的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now if you can justify{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.05,1:06:16.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们就只好分道扬镳了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that we part company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.83,1:06:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚安 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good night Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.56,1:06:27.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对问题做出诊断是一回事 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's one thing to diagnose the problem Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.80,1:06:29.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而通常要解决它又是另一回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's quite another,often,to resolve it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.43,1:06:41.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah your ladyship{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.48,1:06:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是一个绝对灵验的护身符{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}here is a charm that cannot fail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.39,1:06:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把它别在你的枕头上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pin this to your pillow and you can laugh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.53,1:06:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那对着夜里来犯的伪君子和吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Laugh in the face of vampires{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.02,1:06:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你就可以当面耻笑他们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and hypocrites that visit in the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.60,1:06:58.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只需六便士就可以保证你的安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your safety a sixpence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.04,1:07:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有个骗子在招摇撞骗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's a jackal at work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.60,1:07:03.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要去伦敦了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm off to London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.91,1:07:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伦敦？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}London?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.41,1:07:06.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可以坚守堡垒到黄昏吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Till nightfall will you hold the fort?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.97,1:07:07.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Certainly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.32,1:07:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得拜访一下卡洛塔 弗格森{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought a visit to Carlotta Ferguson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.26,1:07:10.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许会有些帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}might be useful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.43,1:07:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为医生 我也许可以进去看她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As a doctor I might get in to see her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.50,1:07:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.55,1:07:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}同时跟她丈夫重修旧好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Also patch things up with her husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.47,1:07:16.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没必要让他反对我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No point in having him against us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.88,1:07:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quite so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.27,1:07:23.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣塞巴斯蒂安会守护你的心灵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Saint Sebastian,he will protect your heart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.98,1:07:26.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}免受吸血鬼 和常见的邪恶的侵害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from vampires and prevalent malignants{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.33,1:07:30.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比如盗尸贼 蝙蝠和吸血蝙蝠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}such as ghouls,bats and bat suckers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.66,1:07:34.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给九便士就是你的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yours for nine pennies only.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.08,1:07:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给你所爱的人吧 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For your loved ones sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.83,1:07:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她病倒了吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Taken back,was she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.51,1:07:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个会打倒魔鬼 让他夜里不再光临{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This will beat the devil and his night visits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.17,1:07:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它是藏在修女们的衣服里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was smuggled in the habit of a nun{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.03,1:07:59.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一路从罗马偷运过来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}all the way from Rome{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.71,1:08:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是以教皇的精神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and was forged{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.01,1:08:04.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来铸造的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in his holiness own spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.24,1:08:08.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 它是那么美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh it's so beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.31,1:08:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在任何恶人都不能近我的身了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now I am safe from all bad people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.65,1:08:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别吵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Silence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.62,1:08:18.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不许那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quit that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.51,1:08:19.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伯恩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Burns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.46,1:08:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}戒指环绕着蔷薇 口袋里装满了花束…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ring around the rosy. Pocket full of posy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.54,1:08:34.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去车站{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To the station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.58,1:08:35.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}回头见 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See you later Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.75,1:09:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}迈克尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Michael.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.89,1:09:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我给你带了这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I got you this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.76,1:09:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以帮你好起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Help ye get better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.15,1:09:16.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是什么迈克尔？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's that Michael?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.94,1:09:17.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.91,1:09:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你刚和她在一起吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've been with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.54,1:09:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.93,1:09:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 维拉 - 出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Vera. - Get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.07,1:09:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 维拉 - 滚啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Vera. - Go on get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.37,1:09:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 维拉 - 放开我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Vera. - Leave me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.28,1:09:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 别碰我 - 维拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Don't touch me. - Vera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.73,1:09:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.08,1:11:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生医生 进来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In here Doctor Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.86,1:11:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她感觉怎么样了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How is she fairing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.19,1:11:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她没告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She doesn't tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.10,1:11:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生医生 夫人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doctor Watson Madame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.12,1:11:21.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.29,1:11:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗格森太太？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mrs. Ferguson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.30,1:11:26.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我现在代履村医之责 他病了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm standing in locum for the village doctor who's sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.80,1:11:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.67,1:11:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道你是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.89,1:11:30.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你昨天来过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were here yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.28,1:11:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请坐吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.50,1:11:39.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你希望跟我说什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So what is it you wish to say to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.91,1:11:42.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想问问经历了这么悲痛的损失后 你还好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To ask how you are after your tragic loss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.34,1:11:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}需不需要什么有助睡眠的药物？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you need anything for sleeping?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.65,1:11:47.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}世上没有任何药物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are no remedies in the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.80,1:11:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能让我夜里睡得着觉的 医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that would make me sleep at night doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.92,1:11:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.59,1:11:53.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但今天不同{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But the day's different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.76,1:11:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我睡着了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.29,1:11:57.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至少不知不觉地几个小时过去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At least hours fly by without me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.33,1:12:03.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想喝点什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you wish for something to drink?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.30,1:12:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 不 不 不 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh no,no. No thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.55,1:12:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的朋友 那位侦探{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're friend the detective{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.06,1:12:07.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今天怎么没和你在一起？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is not with you today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.46,1:12:09.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他去了伦敦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gone to London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.39,1:12:11.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你丈夫是不是告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your husband told you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.21,1:12:12.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}歇洛克 福尔摩斯在村子里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that Sherlock Holmes was in the village?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.74,1:12:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是我丈夫 不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not my husband no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.55,1:12:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 那就是斯托克顿先生了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh then it was Mr. Stockton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.34,1:12:17.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯托克顿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stockton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.55,1:12:19.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是斯托克顿  是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was Stockton yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.54,1:12:22.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他昨天好心地把我带了出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was kind enough to take me out yesterday{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.62,1:12:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟我的女仆一起兜了风{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for a drive with my maid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.98,1:12:25.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你认识斯托克顿吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you know Stockton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.16,1:12:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 我从未见过他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No I haven't met him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.78,1:12:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯认识他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holmes knows him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.36,1:12:32.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他昨天也坐车去了 一所废弃的旧房子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He too went for ride yesterday to an old ruined house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.13,1:12:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.33,1:12:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那房子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.94,1:12:36.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你去过那里吗 夫人？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've been there Madame?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.19,1:12:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只不过是座烧毁了的房子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's just a burned out house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.16,1:12:40.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我毫无兴趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No interest to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.40,1:12:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有鬼吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No ghosts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.03,1:12:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想有很多吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Many I should think{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.56,1:12:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过没有一个出来溜达的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but none came out to play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.28,1:12:48.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你觉得斯托克顿怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you make of Stockton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.35,1:12:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他似乎能激起人们强烈的情感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He seems to arouse strong feelings in people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.60,1:12:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是什么情感呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What should that be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.42,1:12:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说不清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I couldn't tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.33,1:12:55.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只不过是听说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's only what I've heard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.52,1:12:58.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你想听我对斯托克顿的看法吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You want my opinion on Stockton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.20,1:13:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 起初我不喜欢他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well at first I disliked him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.82,1:13:05.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他对我的国家很感兴趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then he was interested about my country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.78,1:13:08.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}又会讲我们的语言 于是我自然欢迎他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He speaks my language and so I welcome him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.09,1:13:10.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 可是村子里… - 我对村子完全不了解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- But the village... - I know nothing of the village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.74,1:13:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}激烈的情绪  正如你说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Strong feelings you say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.20,1:13:17.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}乡巴佬… 英国的乡巴佬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Peasants... English peasants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.23,1:13:22.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而斯托克顿给了你一些安慰？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Stockton offered you some consolation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.07,1:13:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他了解死去的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He understands the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.08,1:13:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}了解我们所发生的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What happens to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.72,1:13:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}了解我们的去向{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.16,1:13:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}知道我的小里卡多去了哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where my little Ricardo has gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.84,1:13:37.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是我仅有的安慰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's the only solace I have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.86,1:13:38.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从你丈夫身上你得不到安慰吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have none with your husband?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.15,1:13:39.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一点也没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}None.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.05,1:13:42.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他干嘛要把我带到这么个糟糕的地方来？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why did he bring me here to this terrible place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.75,1:13:45.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我告诉你吧 因为他想让我的小孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I tell you because he wanted my little baby{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.17,1:13:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}变成一个像杰克那样的英国佬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to be an Englishman like Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.95,1:13:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他想要另一个杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He wanted another boy like Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.68,1:13:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}死后埋在一个英国人的墓地里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is that so wonderful{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.20,1:13:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就真的那么好吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to end up buried in an English grave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.76,1:13:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是我让你难过了 我深表抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sorry if I caused you pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.94,1:14:01.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有什么关系呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.41,1:14:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是位医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are a doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.34,1:14:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}了解真相当然更好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is better to bring the truth out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.38,1:14:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}确实如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.45,1:14:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会留下来用午餐吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And now you will stay for lunch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.08,1:14:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.74,1:14:24.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我留下来用了午餐还有下午茶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I stayed for lunch,tea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.87,1:14:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在花园里喝茶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had tea in the garden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.50,1:14:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她是一个出色的女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's a remarkable woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.80,1:14:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常有教养{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Most cultured person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.01,1:14:32.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想就算是你也会觉得有她陪伴很愉快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think even you would enjoy her company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.65,1:14:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女仆呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the maid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.20,1:14:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 女仆嘛  呃…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Awe now the maid well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.15,1:14:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}迈克尔的脖子上还有吻痕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are still love marks on Michael's neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.81,1:14:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只是在回忆细节{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I'm only recalling the details{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.60,1:14:43.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是因为你想听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}since you asked for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.71,1:14:44.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗格森有没有在场？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Ferguson's part all of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.17,1:14:46.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗格森是在下午三四点回来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ferguson returned mid afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.69,1:14:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.39,1:14:48.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.14,1:14:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克没有回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack hadn't returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.38,1:14:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没人惦记他？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He wasn't missed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.40,1:14:53.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谈起他一两次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Referred to once or twice but missed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.25,1:14:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至于惦记嘛  我说不清{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I couldn't tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.46,1:14:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里的那个女孩呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the girl here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.04,1:14:59.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从早上起一直那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unchanged since this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.24,1:15:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的伦敦之旅呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your trip to London?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.20,1:15:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得去斯托克顿的房间看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought a visit to Stockton's room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.03,1:15:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许更有帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}might be more useful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.41,1:15:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有没有发生什么事情？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did anything happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.39,1:15:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.47,1:15:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}活人和死人都没有出现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Neither the living nor the dead appeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.07,1:15:17.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过尽管如此还是很有益处的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But it was instructive nonetheless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.67,1:15:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.33,1:15:29.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}该死的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Curse the boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.33,1:15:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和你的朋友在一起吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With your friend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.20,1:15:44.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呆在里头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.30,1:15:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.76,1:15:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯托克顿 我要跟你谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stockton I want to talk to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.44,1:15:57.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.34,1:16:00.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.77,1:16:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看看这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.06,1:16:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你干的好事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.21,1:16:10.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的儿子 妻子 女仆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My boy,my wife,my maid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.81,1:16:12.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都是你的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you'll have it all{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.96,1:16:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们成了你乡村宿怨的一部分了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and we're a part of your village vendetta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.96,1:16:18.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抱歉 你在说什么啊？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sorry what are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.78,1:16:21.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你到底想从我们这儿得到什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you want from us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.27,1:16:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是你把你的妻子介绍给我认识的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You introduced me to your wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.99,1:16:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说英语 你这该死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Speak English damn you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.65,1:16:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说英语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Speak English!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.90,1:16:31.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你竟敢侮辱我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How dare you insult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.18,1:16:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.11,1:16:38.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在把她带走 把你的同类带走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now take her,take your creature{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.24,1:16:43.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是看在上帝的份上 留下我的妻子和儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but leave my wife and my boy for God's sake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.11,1:16:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克  留下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.72,1:16:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}留下 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.69,1:16:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}放开他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Leave him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.85,1:16:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让他走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let him go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.09,1:17:20.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.97,1:17:22.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别打了 求你们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't fight please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.24,1:17:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我诅咒你 斯托克顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Curse you Stockton{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.43,1:18:56.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}转过那个弯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Came around that bend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.31,1:19:00.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}车速太快了 地很湿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Traveling too quick. It's wet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.11,1:19:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一次意外 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An accident Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.99,1:19:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的报告会这么写 结案了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That'll be my report. Subject closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.28,1:19:10.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正如你说的有点怪异  警官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A bit odd as you say constable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.08,1:19:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very good then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.16,1:19:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过了今天你就要走了 是吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'll be leaving over this day then will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.16,1:19:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在我们的问题解决了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now are problem's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.00,1:19:19.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有留下的理由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No reason for me to stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.63,1:19:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我推断医生今早也有好转{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I gather the village doctor is better this morning,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.17,1:19:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以你也不再需要华生医生帮忙了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so you won't be needing Dr. Watson's services either?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.47,1:19:29.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 但是对他的帮助我们很感激{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. But his help was appreciated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.97,1:19:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 来吧小伙子们 把事情都干完吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well come on lads, let's get over with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.81,1:19:36.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谋杀？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Murder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.06,1:19:38.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}更难解的谜团之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One of the deeper mysteries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.15,1:19:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们会把他埋在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where will they put him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.90,1:19:47.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}墓地里啊 还能是哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Graveyard where else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.24,1:19:48.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但他不能埋在那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But he can't go there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.07,1:19:51.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我们的国家里 我们有时会火化尸体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In my country sometime they burn the body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.99,1:19:53.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这又不是你们的国家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well this isn't your country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.95,1:19:56.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们这儿可是文明的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're civilized here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.54,1:20:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么你们会把他扔出去喂狼吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So do you would throw him out to be eaten by wolves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.46,1:20:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会把他埋在哪儿 杰克？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where would you bury him Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.09,1:20:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们说的可是你的朋友斯托克顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's your friend Stockton we're talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.51,1:20:10.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你饿吗 亲爱的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You hungry, dear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.35,1:20:13.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.56,1:20:16.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你干嘛那么看着我？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why'd you look at me like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.93,1:20:17.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.03,1:20:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 我得干活去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well I've got to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.86,1:20:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他撞上的是我那棵树{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The tree that he hit was my tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.74,1:20:34.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从上面摔下来的那棵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The one that I fell from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.99,1:20:35.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你去看过那棵树吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've been to see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.58,1:20:38.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那不是你的树 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No your tree Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.67,1:20:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那棵树不在那条路上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It wasn't down that way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.54,1:20:41.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它就在那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.76,1:20:44.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正好是我发生意外的那棵树{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The very same tree where I had my accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.25,1:20:47.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那棵树应该是受过诅咒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Must have a curse on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.96,1:20:48.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want to see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.83,1:20:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你带我去看好吗 迈克尔？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would you take me Michael?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.68,1:20:53.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.80,1:20:54.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你害怕了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you afraid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.06,1:20:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 当然不是了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, of course not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.56,1:21:03.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我带你去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll take you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.94,1:21:06.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}迈克尔？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Michael?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.11,1:21:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你偏要去的话 就迟些时候吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Later if you must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.41,1:21:17.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}世人行动实系徒然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For man walketh in a vain shadow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.59,1:21:20.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们的忙乱亦是枉然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and disquiet himself in vain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.08,1:21:23.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是基督教的葬礼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No Christian burial...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.09,1:21:29.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抛弃他吧 魔鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cast him out, devil...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.59,1:21:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宽恕我所有的罪过吧…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Deliver me from all mine, offences...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.93,1:21:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她在抗议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Voicing her protest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.91,1:22:06.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像是颗炸弹 腐蚀了他的荣耀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Like it was a bomb fretting away his honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.34,1:22:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于是每个人都归于虚无{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Every man therefore is but vanity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.59,1:22:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我向您祈祷 我的主啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here my prayer O'Lord{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.18,1:22:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请倾听我的呼唤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and with thy ears consider my calling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.14,1:22:21.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于我的眼泪求您不要静默无声{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold not thy peace of my tears{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.47,1:22:25.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为在你面前我是一羁旅之人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for I am a stranger with thee and a sojourner{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.19,1:22:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}像我的先人一般{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as all of fathers were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.82,1:22:33.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 求你宽容我 使我在去而不返之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh spare me little that. I may recover my strength,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.36,1:22:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}重获力量…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before I go hence and be no more...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.82,1:22:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.66,1:22:43.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去看看他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.92,1:22:57.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 求你宽容我 让我重获力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh spare me a little that I may recover my strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.64,1:23:05.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.74,1:23:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 我觉得是幽闭恐惧症{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well I think it was claustrophobia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.24,1:23:24.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是什么更糟的情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.73,1:23:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有些人在教堂里就会这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Some people get it in churches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.08,1:23:28.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是他以前每个周日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But he used to sing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.33,1:23:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都在我的唱诗班里唱歌来着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in my choir every Sunday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.63,1:23:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 他和斯托克顿关系比较密切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well he and Stockton have become quite close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.00,1:23:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对他来说应该是个很大的打击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It must have been a terrible shock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.42,1:23:37.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有点像是那么回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What a business...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.69,1:23:39.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}村里人竭力反对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the village up in arms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.34,1:23:43.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我不会反对为他举行基督教的葬礼的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but couldn't deny the man a Christian burial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.77,1:23:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是说我怎么能反对呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean how could I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.27,1:23:47.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他做了什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What has he done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.44,1:23:50.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他有亲戚吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did have any relatives as?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.40,1:23:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 据大家所知 没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well no one as far as anyone knows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.52,1:23:54.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这又带来了另一个问题了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's another problem you see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.98,1:23:56.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的房子怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What to do with his cottage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.09,1:23:57.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有他的财产呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His possessions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.91,1:24:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会去查查那些财产{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall look over the premises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.83,1:24:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们不问问警察吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shouldn't we ask the police?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.54,1:24:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯知道该找什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holmes will know what to look for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.09,1:24:20.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在又开始干清理房子的活了吗 福尔摩斯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the business of house clearing now hey Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.80,1:24:22.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许有益处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It may be instructive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.90,1:25:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那儿有什么味道？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's that smell in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.87,1:25:16.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}向日花吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Heliotrope?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.27,1:25:17.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是腐朽的味道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's the smell of decay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.32,1:25:20.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}麻烦你把那灯点着 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will you light that lamp Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.70,1:25:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们就可以着手工作了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and then we'll set to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.51,1:25:46.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}鬼吗？你要是想的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A ghost? I'll climb up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.05,1:25:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会爬上去把他摇下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and shake him down if you like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.35,1:25:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是他在上面的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It he's up there,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.92,1:25:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也吓不倒我啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it doesn't frighten me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.64,1:25:53.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你吓不了我 斯托克顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can't frighten me, Stockton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.35,1:25:55.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你已经埋在草下了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're under the sod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.69,1:25:57.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那才是你该呆的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where you belong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.69,1:26:01.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你现在烦扰不了任何人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You won't bother nobody now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.33,1:26:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再也不会了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}nor never again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.70,1:26:07.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多莉？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dolly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.66,1:26:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}得了 别玩愚蠢的游戏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on now, don't play silly games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.37,1:26:16.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多莉？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dolly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.02,1:26:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是斯托克顿写的秘鲁的宗教{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here's one by Stockton. Religions in Peru.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.87,1:26:51.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}鱼神  蟹之神 飞狐之神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fish god, Crab god, Fox god in Flight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.79,1:26:58.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}禁忌 魔法 巫术{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Taboos, witchcrafts, sorcery...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.84,1:27:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有什么这人没写到的吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is there nothing this man hasn't dabbled in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.30,1:27:09.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vampires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.85,1:27:13.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这儿有一本关于吸血鬼的书 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's a book here on vampires Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.30,1:27:24.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.50,1:27:25.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她受到了袭击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's been attacked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.54,1:27:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在树下 就是他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Down by the tree. It was him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.87,1:27:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会变成吸血鬼的人 通常是术士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Person to turn vampire generally wizards,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.91,1:27:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自杀者还有那些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}suicides and those{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.00,1:27:38.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}横死或受到诅咒的人…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who come to a violent end or being cursed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.00,1:27:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今晚有两个极好的实验品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tonight two perfect specimens from whence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.03,1:27:43.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我汲取力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I draw my strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.80,1:27:48.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的两位秘鲁女人让我重焕生机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My fvvo Peruvian ladies revived me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.93,1:27:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吸血鬼会把他的受害者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vampire will bring his victim{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.47,1:27:52.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带到鬼门关前 却不会让他过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to the foot of death but not beyond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.26,1:27:54.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他会照料他恢复健康{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will nurse it back to health{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.92,1:27:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用之后所显示出来的爱…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with all the after occurrence of love...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.48,1:28:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然而现在也许我也受到了控制{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yet am I also possessed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.73,1:28:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我去到那房子的时候难道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When I visit the house is she not{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.05,1:28:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是她让我放弃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}commanding me to relinquish,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.11,1:28:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我把能力传给另一个人…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to hand my mantel on to another...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.16,1:28:13.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实上也许会再次被爱并把她吞噬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed may be loved and devour her again{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.95,1:28:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样他就可以永远得到滋养{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}whereby he's forever nourished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.43,1:29:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他呼唤我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He called to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.02,1:29:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把你的梦境告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me your dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.23,1:29:25.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他让我带她到那儿去 我就照做了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She wanted me to take her there so I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.40,1:29:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}本来她还站在那儿的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One minute she was standing there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.57,1:29:28.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一下子就不见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then she was gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.15,1:29:30.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看不到她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I couldn't see her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.74,1:29:32.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}接着她又在树旁出现了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then she appeared again by the tree{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.63,1:29:33.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}倒在我怀里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and fell into my arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.95,1:29:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}脖子上有咬痕和血迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On her neck were bites and blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.91,1:29:37.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是你留下的痕迹吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you make these marks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.24,1:29:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不… 不 先生 不是我 是斯托克顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No... no sir, not I, it was Stockton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.75,1:29:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看见他了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You saw him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.87,1:29:43.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 没有 不过他就在那儿 错不了的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well no, but he was there right enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.92,1:29:45.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯托克顿死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stockton is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.79,1:29:47.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 先生 他没死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No sir, he is not,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.25,1:29:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要么就是他是个活死人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or if it is, it's the living dead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.92,1:29:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝可以作证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as God's my witness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.42,1:29:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看看她身上的齿痕吧 你们自己去看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See the mark on her. See for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.76,1:29:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吸血鬼并不存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vampires don't exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.26,1:29:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}迈克尔 看着我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Michael, look at me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.72,1:30:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们不存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They don't exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.20,1:30:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那条狗怎么啦？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's the matter with the dog?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.25,1:30:24.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}像是有点四肢麻痹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It some form of paralysis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.96,1:30:26.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是不是突然变成这样的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did it come on suddenly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.29,1:30:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}昨天吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.79,1:30:31.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很值得注意而且具有启发性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Remarkable and suggestive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.01,1:30:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说的是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.04,1:30:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这狗与什么事情有关吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's the dog got to do with anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.14,1:30:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此刻我无法告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't tell you this instant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.60,1:30:40.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以允许华生检查一下女仆吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May Watson be permitted to examine the maid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.06,1:30:42.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.77,1:30:51.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那人的死也许有部分是我造成的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The man's death perhaps in part I caused it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.03,1:30:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不否认我发了脾气 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't deny that I lost my temper Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.15,1:30:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但相比起这个家庭所遭受的痛苦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But that's nothing to the suffering{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.77,1:30:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那算不上什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that's been brought to this family,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.16,1:30:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我妻子 我的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my wife, the baby boy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.73,1:31:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而现在又接着发生在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and it continues to be brought{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.41,1:31:06.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女仆身上 跟我解释啊 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}now on the maid. Explain that to me, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.92,1:31:11.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早上好 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good morning, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.46,1:31:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 你就是那位侦探{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Holmes, the detective.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.76,1:31:20.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多洛雷斯好多了 父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dolores is feeling better, father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.94,1:31:30.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有点低烧 没别的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a slight fever nothing worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.11,1:31:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她昨晚跟迈克尔出去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She was out with Michael last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.16,1:31:34.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们遇上了暴风雨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They were caught in a storm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.32,1:31:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吻痕吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lover's marks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.24,1:31:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.37,1:31:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.46,1:31:49.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那棵树还是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is also the tree{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.34,1:31:51.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克小时候摔下来的那棵呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that Jack fell from as a boy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.79,1:31:53.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那次摔下来让他受了伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that caused his injury{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.38,1:31:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他就是这么告诉迈克尔的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or so told Michael.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.88,1:32:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯托克顿和杰克？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stockton and Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.80,1:32:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太难以接受了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now that's too much to swallow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.22,1:32:05.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克在撒谎 我问了弗格森{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack was lying. I asked Ferguson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.23,1:32:08.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克的那棵树在林子的那一头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack's tree is in quite another part of the woods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.23,1:32:10.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是他为什么要撒谎呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But why should he lie about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.31,1:32:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why indeed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.82,1:32:21.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我无能为力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Out of my hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.34,1:32:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是警官决定的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was the constable, he decided.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.37,1:32:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们不能这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.31,1:32:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是违背法律的 是一种侵犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's outside the law. It's a violation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.50,1:32:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亡灵们会怎么看呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well what will the spirits make of it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.07,1:33:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去他不能再危害村子的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Back to where he belongs where he can do this village no harm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.76,1:33:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他想勒死我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He tried to strangle me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.14,1:33:29.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来些水 格雷斯蒂太太{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Some water please, Mrs. Gresty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.35,1:33:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}像是只很大的黑色的动物 猫或是蜘蛛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was like a big black animal, a cat or a spider.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.31,1:33:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}手心有毛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It had hair on the inside of its hands,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.83,1:33:38.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}掐住我的脖子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and they covered my throat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.63,1:34:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那不过是个噩梦 维拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was just a bad dream Vera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.01,1:34:06.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是个噩梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just a bad dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.27,1:34:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不喜欢这里 格雷斯蒂先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't like it here, Mr. Gresty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.15,1:34:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们把他扔了 赶紧走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's drop him and get out fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.03,1:34:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}放在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.53,1:34:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们还干点别的吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are we going to do the other thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.03,1:34:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们怎么对付老鼠的 你知道吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know what you do with the rats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.53,1:34:29.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是个很有点子的人哪 小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've been a mind whip boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.99,1:34:30.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们不是 不是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We haven't, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.45,1:34:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不去那儿  我不去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not going down there, I won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.50,1:34:35.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.79,1:34:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是块耳朵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's from in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.04,1:34:39.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会是谁呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who can it be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.26,1:34:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发生了一起亵渎神明的事件 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's been a desecration, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.06,1:34:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想 斯托克顿回到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stockton has been returned to the home{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.73,1:34:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他先辈们的住地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of his forbearers I would imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.52,1:34:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是警察或主教该管的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's the matter of the police or the bishop,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.19,1:34:59.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}目前不该是我们操心的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}no concern of ours for the moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.73,1:35:01.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女孩子怎么样了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How's the girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.57,1:35:03.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}睡得很安稳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh she's calm, sleeping now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.65,1:35:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有什么痕迹吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Marks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.57,1:35:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}连一道抓痕都没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not a scratch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.53,1:35:06.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}窗户呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Window?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.41,1:35:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从里面闩上了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bolted from the inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.74,1:35:09.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就是癔病了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A case of hysteria, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.62,1:35:10.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是那个弗格森的女仆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But the Ferguson maid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.71,1:35:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 我发誓…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holmes, I swear...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.74,1:35:13.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我们是该认真对待{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes that we must take seriously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.21,1:35:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你来吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.91,1:35:14.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.61,1:35:47.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.61,1:36:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的嘴上滴着血  他看见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She'd blood on her mouth he saw it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.07,1:36:26.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她跟那个斯托克顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She and that man Stockton,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.40,1:36:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们两个都是吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}both of them vampires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.15,1:36:29.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的女主人现在在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}where's your mistress now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.53,1:36:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}锁在她自己房间里 她是个怪物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Locked in her room, she is a monster{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.28,1:36:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她能看见我吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would she see me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.12,1:36:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她就是魔鬼 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's the devil, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.33,1:36:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女仆呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The maid then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.99,1:36:34.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}男孩上哪去了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where's the boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.99,1:36:36.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克吗？噢 我想他在房间里吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack? Oh he's in his room, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.04,1:36:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗格森先生 我不知道他在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Ferguson, I don't know where he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.76,1:38:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是毒药 我想是管箭毒碱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was poison. Curare I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.63,1:38:15.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她不会死吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will she live?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.59,1:38:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不会 卡洛塔发现了 她想把{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes. Carlotta discovered it was attempting to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.60,1:38:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毒液吸出来 他知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}suck the venom out, you knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.22,1:38:21.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从斯托克顿那偷来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stolen from Stockton,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.69,1:38:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或者是斯托克顿给了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or perhaps Stockton gave it to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.81,1:38:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}浸过管箭毒碱的箭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An arrow dipped in curare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.86,1:38:29.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}造成脖子处两个小小的伤口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two small incisions into the neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.94,1:38:34.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他先是在狗身上做实验{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He tried it on the dog first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.24,1:38:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.33,1:38:40.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道在房间里的可能是杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I knew it couldn't be Jack in the ruin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.91,1:38:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我听见他在斯托克顿的屋子里拉琴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I heard him playing the violin at Stockton's house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.41,1:38:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个鬼怪又是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what about the ghost?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.67,1:38:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}利用光线搞的把戏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Trick of the light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.75,1:38:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是废墟成了杰克的游戏场所{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But the ruin had become Jack's playground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.88,1:38:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我第二次去那里就看到他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I saw him there on my second visit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.33,1:38:52.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在在这里又看到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and now here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.01,1:38:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的灵感都藏在橱柜里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His inspiration hidden away in Cupboards,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.09,1:38:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个心理失常的少年心中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a dark world of imagination{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.31,1:39:03.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被幻想出的黑暗世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}brought alive by a disturbed adolescent boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.89,1:39:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是假装成吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But to pretend to be a vampire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.31,1:39:07.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 华生 是相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, Watson, believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.23,1:39:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他相信他自己是个吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Believe he is a vampire{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.77,1:39:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还记得他在教堂里的举止吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Remember his behavior in the church?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.57,1:39:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他对十字架的恐惧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His fear of the cross?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.03,1:39:16.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯托克顿也是吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Stockton too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.40,1:39:19.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 他注意到斯托克顿对人们造成的影响{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why not? He saw Stockton's affect upon people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.74,1:39:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他对女人的控制力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His control over women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.11,1:39:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有什么比当这个更好呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What better thing to be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.00,1:39:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了赢得尊敬 友爱 也许还有爱情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To win the respects, affection, love perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.04,1:39:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们必须找到他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.68,1:39:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他会在废墟里跟他的主人在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He'll be at the ruin with his master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.15,1:40:39.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿你坠入地狱 炼狱之火燃烧不歇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get thee to hell, burned forever and a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.95,1:40:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿你邪恶的身躯被豺狼吞噬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let thy foul carcass be food for jackals,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.37,1:40:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿你的阴谋无法得逞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and thy blood drink for pariah dogs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.07,1:41:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}头部受到了重击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a blow to the head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.95,1:41:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}确保他能活下去 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See that he lives, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.93,1:41:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.02,1:41:53.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.33,1:42:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她们要回到她的国家去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well they are returning to her country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.21,1:42:57.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个村子没有什么可以让她们留恋了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They have nothing in this village to keep them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.17,1:42:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也没有可以挽留你们的了 我的好朋友们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and neither have you my good friends{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.00,1:43:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过我永远会心怀感激{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I for one shall remember{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.65,1:43:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将你们付出的努力铭刻在心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your efforts with gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.76,1:43:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯托克顿的事呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This business with Stockton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.22,1:43:10.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会悄悄调往另一个教区 不再操心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll remove to another parish quietly, no fuss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.64,1:43:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿他安息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May he rest in peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.89,1:43:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.45,1:43:35.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那婴儿呢 福尔摩斯？你该不会认为…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The baby Holmes? You don't think...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.33,1:43:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我尊重你的专业意见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I respect the verdict of your profession.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.44,1:43:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}肺炎 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Phenomena wasn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.59,1:43:41.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那斯托克顿的死呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Stockton's death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.09,1:43:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}意外或是命运 谁知道呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Accident, fate, who knows{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.08,1:43:46.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过杰克不是谋杀犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but Jack was no murderer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.55,1:43:49.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}挂坠里斯托克顿的肖像又是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stockton's face in the locket?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.26,1:43:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个聪明的孩子从一张照片中得到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Got from a photograph by a clever child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.60,1:43:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些事件会被记录下来吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will there be any record of these events?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.56,1:43:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}兰伯利的吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The vampire of Lamberley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.19,1:44:03.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.07,1:44:06.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许世人对此还没有做好心理准备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps the world is not yet prepared.{\r}
